# A87 kernel desktop (sd-base, no #Z). Its ADMENU THEACTIVE is built
# screen-wide (kernel/src/desk/menu.rs build_menu: o[2] width = sw), so
# gl_ctwait covers the whole row and the rest right of the last title
# still belongs to the control manager — no visible change expected
# (out of scope: desk/ deviates from EmuTOS adjust_menu, deskmain.c:1534).
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 400 8
1900 mark B_REST_RIGHT_OF_TITLES
2200 down
2203 up
2700 mark C_CLICKED_THERE
3000 parkbr
3600 mark D_PARKED
3900 move 76 8
4400 mark E_FILE_OPEN
4700 parkbr
5300 mark F_PARKED_AGAIN
